sequenceDiagram
  participant V as Visitor
  participant P as BrandStoryPage
  participant C as CounterHook
  participant A as AnalyticsEmitter
  participant GA as GA4

  V->>P: Scroll to impact metrics section
  P->>C: notify visible=true
  C->>C: Start counter animation (respect reduced motion)
  C-->>P: Render animated values
  P->>A: emit brand_timeline_scroll_depth {percent:75}
  A-->>GA: POST measurement payload
  V->>P: Click "Find a dealer" CTA
  P->>A: emit brand_cta_click {target:"dealers"}
  P-->>V: Navigate to `/dealers`
